    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Quantify embryonic character similarity among animal groups and test whether it predicts independently inferred molecular common ancestry and improves classification relative to adult convergence-prone characters. Agreement supports embryonic structure as evidence of descent.";
